  "welcome": "<div class=\"shell\"><div class=\"screen\"><div class=\"scroll-wrap\"><div class=\"scroll\"><div class=\"page safe\"><div class=\"hero\"><img class=\"logo\" src=\"assets/img/icon.svg\" alt=\"\"><h2>Pocket Pilot</h2><p>Your Copilot agents, in your pocket. Chat, approve tool calls and get notified — wherever you are. Works with VS Code and the GitHub Copilot app.</p></div><button class=\"btn block primary\" style=\"margin-top: 14px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H8a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2zM11 18h2\"></path></svg> Scan the QR code</button><ol class=\"steps\"><li><div><b>Install Pocket Pilot on your PC</b><div class=\"muted small\">The VS Code extension or the GitHub Copilot app plugin — see <a href=\"https://mithawala.github.io/pocket-pilot/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">mithawala.github.io/pocket-pilot</a>.</div></div></li><li><div><b>Turn on remote access</b><div class=\"muted small\">VS Code: “Start remote access” in the Pocket Pilot panel. Copilot app or CLI: type <b>/pocket-pilot</b> in a chat.</div></div></li><li><div><b>Scan the QR code</b><div class=\"muted small\">With the button above or your camera — on a computer, paste the pairing link below.</div></div></li></ol><div class=\"trust\"><div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 11H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2zM7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg> End-to-end encrypted — even the tunnel can’t read it</div><div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"></path></svg> Only devices you approve on your PC, with Face ID / fingerprint</div><div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9z\"></path></svg> Free: no accounts, no servers, no tracking</div></div><a class=\"btn block\" href=\"./?demo\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">Try the demo first</a><details class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top: 14px;\"><summary class=\"muted\">I have a pairing link</summary><div class=\"stack\" style=\"margin-top: 12px;\"><input class=\"input\" placeholder=\"Paste the pairing link from your PC\"><button class=\"btn primary\" disabled=\"\">Continue</button></div></details><p class=\"muted small center\" style=\"margin-top: 14px;\">Pocket Pilot 0.7.5</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"toasts\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div>",
